58
00:02:23,040 --> 00:02:23,800
Even more handsome today.

59
00:02:23,800 --> 00:02:24,680
And even more handsome tomorrow.

60
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:26,640
Well, you're definitely
not wrong about that.

61
00:02:28,040 --> 00:02:29,000
Let's see

62
