102
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:41,400
Grasslands.

103
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:42,340
(Grassland Group +1)

104
00:03:42,380 --> 00:03:43,160
(Grassland Group +1)

105
00:03:43,160 --> 00:03:44,080
