I'm here to join the fun.

136
00:04:12,160 --> 00:04:13,200
Welcome.

137
00:04:13,200 --> 00:04:14,760
I'm jumping right into the fun.

138
00:04:14,760 --> 00:04:15,560
Let's go "KTV".

139
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:16,400
Let's go.

140
00:04:16,400 --> 00:04:17,360
