182
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:18,640
Whoa!

183
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:20,240
Sheep!

184
00:05:20,440 --> 00:05:21,560
(Grassland Group)
Little lambs.

185
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:23,350
