191
00:05:29,020 --> 00:05:29,950
Whoa!

192
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:33,960
Sheep.

193
00:05:34,080 --> 00:05:34,800
Little lambs.

194
00:05:37,420 --> 00:05:38,860
(Volcano Group)

195
00:05:38,880 --> 00:05:39,720
Cui Yihang.

196
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,560
The car behind us

197
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:42,360
