So many sheep.

225
00:06:16,760 --> 00:06:17,800
Yu "Yang".
[*"Yang" sounds like "sheep"]

226
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:18,880
Yeah, Yu "Yang".

227
00:06:20,120 --> 00:06:20,400
