288
00:08:35,700 --> 00:08:38,060
(Perfectly happy together)

289
00:08:43,540 --> 00:08:44,300
(Looks back)

290
00:08:48,860 --> 00:08:51,500
(The gap between them slowly closes)

291
00:08:54,540 --> 00:08:55,940
(The mud he kicked up himself)

292
00:08:59,220 --> 00:09:00,660
(Slows down)

293
00:09:04,560 --> 00:09:05,160
There's so much dirt.

294
00:09:05,580 --> 00:09:06,540
(Chen Hewen, Cui Yihang, Wu Siying,
Yu Yang, Liang Renfang)

295
00:09:06,540 --> 00:09:07,580
(Slows down)

296
00:09:08,540 --> 00:09:09,180
(Chen Hewen)

297
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:11,440
We're getting close to the volcano.

298
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:14,080
We're here.

299
00:09:21,140 --> 00:09:22,860
(Chen Hewen arrives first)

300
00:09:24,980 --> 00:09:26,820
("SiYi" arrives second)
Not bad.

301
00:09:28,400 --> 00:09:29,040
Are you cold?

302
00:09:29,040 --> 00:09:29,960
(Concerned)
I'm not cold, babe.

303
00:09:29,960 --> 00:09:31,120
Your hands feel cold.

304
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:32,400
I'm fine now, and I'm wearing gloves.

305
00:09:32,400 --> 00:09:33,040
I'm really not cold, babe.

306
00:09:34,680 --> 00:09:35,480
Your hair, babe.

307
00:09:37,400 --> 00:09:38,000
It's okay.

308
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:40,640
It's fine, right? It's fine.

309
00:09:41,080 --> 00:09:42,120
No, wait.

310
00:09:42,120 --> 00:09:42,800
What's wrong?

311
00:09:43,800 --> 00:09:44,560
What?

312
00:09:46,320 --> 00:09:48,200
Don't move. Give me your gloves.

313
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:49,480
What is that?

314
00:09:52,560 --> 00:09:53,320
What is it?

315
00:09:58,880 --> 00:10:01,200
This stuff got sand all over my face.

316
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:01,760
Really?

317
00:10:01,760 --> 00:10:03,160
I can barely open my eyes.

318
00:10:03,160 --> 00:10:04,360
There's sand in my eyes.

319
00:10:04,460 --> 00:10:05,440
(Helping clean up)

320
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:05,920
The wind blew it in.

321
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:08,560
Did you get it out?

322
00:10:08,560 --> 00:10:09,000
Yeah.

323
00:10:09,640 --> 00:10:11,240
Climb up there,
and I'll take some pictures of you.

324
00:10:25,140 --> 00:10:26,020
(Using a reverse grip)

325
00:10:26,020 --> 00:10:27,300
Now that's what I call a pro.

326
00:10:27,300 --> 00:10:29,620
(Working hard to get the perfect shot)

327
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:32,920
Let me see.

328
00:10:34,240 --> 00:10:34,560
Not bad.

329
00:10:34,560 --> 00:10:35,680
Looks good.

330
00:10:35,680 --> 00:10:37,240
You're really good at this.

331
00:10:38,720 --> 00:10:39,640
Let me take one like this for you.

332
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:40,520
Let's take one together.

333
00:10:40,520 --> 00:10:41,320
We can put them side by side.

334
00:10:41,320 --> 00:10:41,600
Okay.

335
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:43,260
(Taking pictures of each other)

336
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:45,360
Sit here. I'll take a picture of you.

337
00:10:45,360 --> 00:10:46,000
On the car.

338
00:10:48,080 --> 00:10:49,360
One, two, three.

339
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:51,440
Just act natural.

340
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:55,480
Chen Hewen, let me take

341
00:10:55,480 --> 00:10:56,480
(Notices)
some pictures of you.

342
00:10:56,500 --> 00:10:57,520
(Handling work)

343
00:10:57,520 --> 00:10:58,120
Come on.

344
00:10:58,120 --> 00:10:58,760
Give me your phone.

345
00:10:58,760 --> 00:10:59,280
I'll take a few for you.

346
00:10:59,280 --> 00:11:00,240
My hair's a total mess now.

347
00:11:00,240 --> 00:11:00,920
Can we even get a good shot?

348
00:11:00,920 --> 00:11:02,480
Of course. It's a messy look.

349
00:11:03,620 --> 00:11:04,700
(Glances)

350
00:11:09,520 --> 00:11:10,600
Are you sure, Si?

351
00:11:10,600 --> 00:11:11,700
It looks good.

352
00:11:11,780 --> 00:11:13,220
(Checking the shot)
Trust her.

353
00:11:16,360 --> 00:11:16,840
Not bad.

354
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,400
Right? You look cool.

355
00:11:21,040 --> 00:11:22,040
Thanks.

356
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:23,640
Thanks, Si.

357
00:11:23,920 --> 00:11:24,520
No problem.

358
00:11:26,300 --> 00:11:27,540
(Taking a selfie)

359
00:11:29,380 --> 00:11:30,100
(Wants a kiss)

360
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:36,760
Babe.

361
00:11:37,240 --> 00:11:39,040
I'll take a picture of you here.
Come on.

362
00:11:41,580 --> 00:11:42,820
(Adjusting the angle)

363
00:11:44,320 --> 00:11:45,000
Cool and fierce.

364
00:11:48,280 --> 00:11:48,760
Hop out.

365
00:11:49,120 --> 00:11:51,240
Then lean against this like this.

366
00:11:52,280 --> 00:11:52,840
Like this, babe.

367
00:11:54,260 --> 00:11:54,820
(Demonstrating)

368
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:55,440
How's this?

369
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:55,920
Okay.

370
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:58,520
Was your hand like this just now?

371
00:11:58,520 --> 00:11:59,320
Anything works.

372
00:11:59,640 --> 00:12:00,660
Straighten your left leg.

373
00:12:00,660 --> 00:12:01,560
(Teaching and learning)

374
00:12:01,560 --> 00:12:02,720
Right, rest it on top.

375
00:12:03,560 --> 00:12:03,840
Like this?

376
00:12:03,840 --> 00:12:04,320
Yeah.

377
00:12:09,320 --> 00:12:10,240
So beautiful.

378
00:12:10,690 --> 00:12:11,420
Oh my God!

379
00:12:13,480 --> 00:12:15,200
How can you look so cool?

380
00:12:15,500 --> 00:12:16,980
(Laughs at the teasing)

381
00:12:17,580 --> 00:12:18,980
(Creative mode activated)
Oh my!

382
00:12:19,180 --> 00:12:20,160
(Steps back)

383
00:12:20,160 --> 00:12:20,920
Babe, don't move.

384
00:12:21,440 --> 00:12:22,600
(Circling Xing)
Keep that cool expression.

385
00:12:23,600 --> 00:12:24,320
Perfect.

386
00:12:26,000 --> 00:12:27,880
(Circling Xing)
So beautiful, so fierce, so cool.

387
00:12:28,500 --> 00:12:29,620
(Standing on tiptoe with all his might)

388
00:12:30,220 --> 00:12:31,060
(Higher)

389
00:12:31,060 --> 00:12:31,860
(A little higher)

390
00:12:32,820 --> 00:12:33,640
(Another new idea)

391
00:12:33,640 --> 00:12:34,280
Stand on top of it.

392
00:12:35,680 --> 00:12:36,600
Isn't that a little too much?

393
00:12:36,600 --> 00:12:38,420
(Is this really a good idea?)
I mean.

394
00:12:38,880 --> 00:12:39,860
(Trust me)
You look cool!

395
00:12:43,520 --> 00:12:44,560
Xing, I love you even more now.

396
00:12:46,360 --> 00:12:47,560
How can you be so beautiful?

397
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:48,360
Absolutely gorgeous.

398
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:51,280
(Endless compliments)
How can you be this beautiful?

399
00:12:57,960 --> 00:12:58,800
Raise your hands.

400
00:13:04,500 --> 00:13:05,660
(Are we done?)

401
00:13:06,100 --> 00:13:07,260
(One more shot)

402
00:13:07,800 --> 00:13:09,000
Like this. Learn from me.

403
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:09,520
(Glances)
Learning.

404
00:13:09,520 --> 00:13:10,400
Can you sit up there?

405
00:13:10,400 --> 00:13:11,840
This looks cool.

406
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:12,720
Wait a second.

407
00:13:15,560 --> 00:13:16,160
Cool.

408
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:18,480
(Same angle)
Looks good.

409
00:13:18,480 --> 00:13:19,440
Cool.

410
00:13:19,720 --> 00:13:20,800
Come on, get up on the car.

411
00:13:20,800 --> 00:13:21,320
Okay.

412
00:13:23,920 --> 00:13:24,560
Careful.

413
00:13:25,160 --> 00:13:26,640
They're all climbing onto the car
to take pictures now.

414
00:13:32,320 --> 00:13:33,800
Hold on.

415
00:13:33,800 --> 00:13:34,240
Give me a kiss.

416
00:13:47,720 --> 00:13:48,320
Let's go sit over there.

417
00:13:51,720 --> 00:13:53,240
This is so much fun.

418
00:13:53,680 --> 00:13:54,880
Our second "honeymoon".

419
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:57,240
It's hollow inside.

420
00:13:58,480 --> 00:13:59,760
That's the volcano over there.

421
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:00,960
It's black.

422
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:05,960
This looks tasty.

423
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:07,920
Almonds.

424
00:14:07,920 --> 00:14:09,220
(Feeding)

425
00:14:10,080 --> 00:14:11,560
"Little lucky one".

426
00:14:14,920 --> 00:14:16,440
This scratched my hand.

427
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:17,360
The beef jerky.

428
00:14:18,320 --> 00:14:18,760
Wait a second.

429
00:14:18,760 --> 00:14:19,360
Don't squeeze it.

430
00:14:23,880 --> 00:14:24,480
Here.

431
00:14:24,820 --> 00:14:25,740
(Feeding)

432
00:14:26,160 --> 00:14:27,200
Eat up.

433
00:14:27,280 --> 00:14:28,080
Come on, open your mouth.

434
00:14:28,140 --> 00:14:29,420
(Feeding directly)

435
00:14:30,080 --> 00:14:30,840
Another day of getting fed

436
00:14:30,840 --> 00:14:32,420
(The taste of happiness)
by Sun Bohan.

437
00:14:34,240 --> 00:14:35,160
One more.

438
00:14:35,520 --> 00:14:35,800
You eat it.

439
00:14:35,800 --> 00:14:36,840
(Feeds her again)
Just one more.

440
00:14:36,840 --> 00:14:37,520
That's too much.

441
00:14:40,920 --> 00:14:41,480
Babe, you're...

442
00:14:43,680 --> 00:14:44,400
so aloof today.

443
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:47,240
So, do you like me

444
00:14:47,240 --> 00:14:47,960
acting aloof or not?

445
00:14:48,640 --> 00:14:49,480
I like you either way.

446
00:14:51,640 --> 00:14:52,920
You seem a little distant today.

447
00:14:53,760 --> 00:14:54,560
Really?

448
00:14:55,360 --> 00:14:56,520
Can I act a little aloof too?

449
00:14:58,280 --> 00:14:58,760
No.

450
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:00,960
I've always wanted

451
00:15:00,960 --> 00:15:02,040
to act a little aloof, but...

452
00:15:02,680 --> 00:15:03,840
You can't act aloof with me.

453
00:15:03,840 --> 00:15:04,360
Why not?

454
00:15:05,200 --> 00:15:05,840
I can't act aloof with you?

455
00:15:05,840 --> 00:15:06,280
(Helping)
No, I don't want.

456
00:15:06,280 --> 00:15:07,000
I just want a little.

457
00:15:07,000 --> 00:15:08,000
(Being playful)
Nope. I wasn't gonna give it to you.

458
00:15:09,840 --> 00:15:10,680
I'm sorry.

459
00:15:10,680 --> 00:15:11,440
Here you go.

460
00:15:12,680 --> 00:15:14,640
When I'm around you,

461
00:15:14,640 --> 00:15:15,720
I'm just like a "golden retriever".

462
00:15:15,720 --> 00:15:17,000
They say

463
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:17,720
I start grinning...

464
00:15:17,720 --> 00:15:18,120
The moment I see you.

465
00:15:18,120 --> 00:15:19,320
I start grinning
before I even get to you.

466
00:15:20,320 --> 00:15:21,600
So, do you want that?

467
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:23,320
Do you want that?

468
00:15:23,880 --> 00:15:24,400
I do.

469
00:15:24,400 --> 00:15:26,380
(Being playful again)
But I'm not gonna do it.

470
00:15:26,920 --> 00:15:28,000
Look at you, grinning already.

471
00:15:28,220 --> 00:15:29,520
(Stops smiling)

472
00:15:29,520 --> 00:15:30,320
You'd better not smile.

473
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:31,520
I'm not gonna smile
when I see you today.

474
00:15:31,520 --> 00:15:32,000
Okay?

475
00:15:35,420 --> 00:15:36,660
(I'm seriously done with you)

476
00:15:36,680 --> 00:15:37,520
When the three of us

477
00:15:37,520 --> 00:15:38,560
first met...

478
00:15:38,800 --> 00:15:39,680
Our first meeting.

479
00:15:40,720 --> 00:15:41,920
Are you not
using your old names anymore?

480
00:15:44,040 --> 00:15:44,960
That was so funny.

481
00:15:44,960 --> 00:15:45,400
But...

482
00:15:45,400 --> 00:15:45,760
Xing.

483
00:15:45,760 --> 00:15:46,480
How old are you?

484
00:15:46,480 --> 00:15:47,360
Right.

485
00:15:47,360 --> 00:15:48,480
So, Xing, how old are you?

486
00:15:49,760 --> 00:15:50,680
I was still trying to figure it out.
I was like...

487
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:51,960
What's going on with Si?

488
00:15:51,960 --> 00:15:53,720
And then my ears turned bright red.

489
00:15:54,240 --> 00:15:55,360
I'm supporting myself with one hand.

490
00:15:55,360 --> 00:15:56,280
You're using both hands for support.

491
00:15:56,280 --> 00:15:57,760
Triangles are structurally stable.

492
00:15:57,760 --> 00:15:58,360
That isn't stable.

493
00:15:58,360 --> 00:15:59,160
You need to do it like this.

494
00:15:59,480 --> 00:15:59,920
That's not stable.

495
00:15:59,920 --> 00:16:00,440
I'm doing it like this.

496
00:16:01,520 --> 00:16:02,400
What a coincidence.

497
00:16:02,400 --> 00:16:03,280
We must be meant to meet.

498
00:16:05,680 --> 00:16:06,320
Did the wind chill you to the bone?

499
00:16:06,320 --> 00:16:07,760
(Concerned)
Are you only wearing one layer?

500
00:16:07,760 --> 00:16:08,480
I'm super warm.

501
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:10,400
- My hands are super warm.
- Is there another layer underneath?

502
00:16:10,400 --> 00:16:10,880
Yeah.

503
00:16:10,880 --> 00:16:11,440
Then you're good.

504
00:16:11,440 --> 00:16:12,200
There's padding inside.

505
00:16:12,200 --> 00:16:12,800
It's pretty chilly out here.

506
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:14,360
Want a tissue?

507
00:16:15,040 --> 00:16:15,560
Want some?

508
00:16:15,600 --> 00:16:16,080
Give me some.

509
00:16:18,560 --> 00:16:19,480
Here, a tissue.

510
00:16:19,480 --> 00:16:20,200
Thanks.

511
00:16:20,280 --> 00:16:21,440
Thanks, Yu Yang.

512
00:16:21,840 --> 00:16:23,200
Let's get some hot water to drink.

513
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:23,840
Here, Yu Yang.

514
00:16:23,840 --> 00:16:24,440
This spot

515
00:16:24,440 --> 00:16:25,960
was practically

516
00:16:25,960 --> 00:16:27,280
custom-made just for you.

517
00:16:28,040 --> 00:16:29,840
Yu Yang's like the big brother
of the group.

518
00:16:29,840 --> 00:16:30,560
He really is.

519
00:16:31,760 --> 00:16:32,120
Here.

520
00:16:32,920 --> 00:16:33,840
Thanks, Yu Yang.

521
00:16:34,800 --> 00:16:36,320
You were driving
pretty fast earlier, Chen Hewen.

522
00:16:37,160 --> 00:16:38,400
I was driving pretty well, actually.

523
00:16:38,400 --> 00:16:39,440
I was afraid Cui Yihang would

524
00:16:39,440 --> 00:16:39,840
catch up to me.

525
00:16:40,720 --> 00:16:41,740
(I'm gonna speak my mind)
When we were turning,

526
00:16:42,040 --> 00:16:42,600
I wanted to pass you,

527
00:16:42,600 --> 00:16:43,360
or at least get farther away from you.

528
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:43,920
It was all dirt flying everywhere.

529
00:16:44,440 --> 00:16:45,080
Then you pulled up beside me,

530
00:16:45,080 --> 00:16:45,840
and I saw you grinning from ear to ear.

531
00:16:48,200 --> 00:16:48,800
You were driving like a maniac.

532
00:16:48,800 --> 00:16:50,080
You really got a thrill
out of that ride.

533
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:50,840
He really isn't even

534
00:16:51,520 --> 00:16:52,280
in the same league as me

535
00:16:52,280 --> 00:16:53,080
when it comes to driving.

536
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:53,680
That's all I can say.

537
00:16:53,700 --> 00:16:54,560
(What do you mean?)

538
00:16:54,560 --> 00:16:55,600
You couldn't even see my taillights,
could you, Cui Yihang?

539
00:16:56,280 --> 00:16:56,680
Nope.

540
00:16:56,680 --> 00:16:57,320
I really couldn't see them.

541
00:16:57,640 --> 00:16:58,600
Because this vehicle doesn't even
have taillights.

542
00:17:03,040 --> 00:17:03,680
Honestly, why don't you

543
00:17:03,680 --> 00:17:04,480
let Si drive later?

544
00:17:04,480 --> 00:17:05,720
Si would probably

545
00:17:05,720 --> 00:17:06,480
be faster than you.

546
00:17:14,560 --> 00:17:15,320
Let's clink glasses.

547
00:17:15,320 --> 00:17:15,760
Happy.

548
00:17:15,760 --> 00:17:16,760
Cheers! Come on!

549
00:17:16,760 --> 00:17:17,200
Bottoms up.

550
00:17:17,200 --> 00:17:17,760
Happy.

551
00:17:23,160 --> 00:17:25,160
Let's take a group photo.

552
00:17:25,160 --> 00:17:26,120
Sure. Let's take one.

553
00:17:26,120 --> 00:17:26,640
Come on.

554
00:17:27,360 --> 00:17:27,800
Let's get a group shot.

555
00:17:28,640 --> 00:17:29,720
We could set the camera up over here,

556
00:17:29,720 --> 00:17:31,200
(Holding hands)
then stand underneath that spot.

557
00:17:31,200 --> 00:17:31,720
That way, we can get

558
00:17:31,720 --> 00:17:32,480
both the volcano and us in the picture.

559
00:17:35,880 --> 00:17:36,560
Are you freezing from the wind?

560
00:17:37,240 --> 00:17:37,720
I'm okay.

561
00:17:38,720 --> 00:17:39,000
Are you cold?

562
00:17:39,000 --> 00:17:39,840
I'm fine. It's not too bad.

563
00:17:41,680 --> 00:17:42,480
It's a little chilly.

564
00:17:42,480 --> 00:17:43,000
The wind's blowing right on us.

565
00:17:43,440 --> 00:17:44,460
Your jacket's pretty thin.

566
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:46,560
I'm okay.

567
00:17:46,560 --> 00:17:47,920
You should've brought a windbreaker.

568
00:17:48,980 --> 00:17:49,940
(Hugging)

569
00:17:52,360 --> 00:17:53,200
Are you cold, Cui Yihang?

570
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:53,640
A little.

571
00:17:53,640 --> 00:17:54,920
You're only wearing
that one layer underneath?

572
00:17:54,920 --> 00:17:55,520
Yeah, just this.

573
00:17:55,800 --> 00:17:57,320
You're pretty bold, young man.

574
00:17:57,720 --> 00:17:58,280
I didn't think it through.

575
00:17:59,080 --> 00:18:00,600
Let's get the volcano in the shot.

576
00:18:00,600 --> 00:18:01,160
Come on.

577
00:18:03,140 --> 00:18:04,100
(Changing positions)

578
00:18:04,240 --> 00:18:05,160
Move a little closer.

579
00:18:05,160 --> 00:18:06,320
(Move closer)
It's distorted!

580
00:18:14,160 --> 00:18:16,400
Yeah! Chinese people can fly!

581
00:18:18,080 --> 00:18:19,840
Chinese people can fly!

582
00:18:24,860 --> 00:18:27,260
(Grassland Group)

583
00:18:27,280 --> 00:18:27,960
It's so beautiful.

584
00:18:31,440 --> 00:18:32,400
There are so many horses.

585
00:18:33,180 --> 00:18:34,240
(Xile Township Ranch)

586
00:18:34,240 --> 00:18:35,000
Sheepies.

587
00:18:37,080 --> 00:18:38,760
You sound just like one.

588
00:18:39,880 --> 00:18:41,240
Hello, everyone.

589
00:18:41,440 --> 00:18:43,880
The road around here is pretty rough,

590
00:18:43,880 --> 00:18:45,680
so we'll ride horses to get you across.
Come on.

591
00:18:45,680 --> 00:18:46,760
Let's get on the horses.

592
00:18:46,760 --> 00:18:48,480
Does each person get their own horse?

593
00:18:48,480 --> 00:18:49,560
One horse per person.

594
00:18:49,560 --> 00:18:50,400
That's so cool.

595
00:18:50,400 --> 00:18:51,300
Hello.

596
00:18:51,300 --> 00:18:52,760
(Hi)
Hello.

597
00:18:53,020 --> 00:18:54,260
(Hello, everyone)

598
00:18:54,280 --> 00:18:55,240
I'll take this one.

599
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:57,040
How do I get on?

600
00:18:57,040 --> 00:18:57,800
Put your left foot.

601
00:18:57,800 --> 00:18:59,260
(Stepping forward to help)

602
00:19:00,800 --> 00:19:01,680
Do I just climb on?

603
00:19:01,680 --> 00:19:02,680
(Helping her up)
Yep, just get on.

604
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:04,040
That's scary.

605
00:19:04,040 --> 00:19:04,920
Don't be scared.

606
00:19:04,940 --> 00:19:06,460
(Don't be nervous. I'm super gentle)

607
00:19:06,560 --> 00:19:07,680
Then I'll ride this one.

608
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:10,200
This reminds me of "My Fair Princess".

609
00:19:11,200 --> 00:19:11,960
Cui Kaiyi, you can start singing in a bit.

610
00:19:11,960 --> 00:19:13,480
Once we all start singing,

611
00:19:13,480 --> 00:19:14,280
it'll be hilarious.

612
00:19:14,480 --> 00:19:15,680
Alright, get ready.

613
00:19:16,080 --> 00:19:17,160
Let's go.

614
00:19:17,160 --> 00:19:17,760
Go.

615
00:19:21,280 --> 00:19:22,480
Babe, look at the camera.

616
00:19:22,480 --> 00:19:23,560
I'm scared.

617
00:19:23,560 --> 00:19:24,360
You can't look.

618
00:19:25,920 --> 00:19:26,680
Let's ride the horses

619
00:19:26,960 --> 00:19:28,440
over to see the sheep.

620
00:19:33,960 --> 00:19:35,720
I'm about to climb onto yours.

621
00:19:36,700 --> 00:19:38,060
(Holding hands)

622
00:19:38,400 --> 00:19:39,400
Still scared?

623
00:19:39,680 --> 00:19:40,480
This is so much fun.

624
00:19:43,280 --> 00:19:44,920
Your "yay" sounded so reluctant.

625
00:19:46,120 --> 00:19:47,560
Slow down.

626
00:19:47,720 --> 00:19:48,320
Meng,

627
00:19:48,320 --> 00:19:50,120
your horse just pooped.

628
00:19:51,520 --> 00:19:52,760
Okay, let's stop here.

629
00:19:52,760 --> 00:19:54,000
We can walk over from here.

630
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:55,080
Just get off.

631
00:19:56,360 --> 00:19:57,120
Come on.

632
00:19:57,600 --> 00:19:58,280
Here.

633
00:19:58,280 --> 00:19:58,720
(Catching her)

634
00:19:58,720 --> 00:19:59,600
These three horses.

635
00:20:00,600 --> 00:20:01,840
They suddenly started playing around.

636
00:20:03,640 --> 00:20:04,840
Your legs are shaking from fear.

637
00:20:07,860 --> 00:20:09,020
(Hugging)

638
00:20:10,280 --> 00:20:11,440
That was terrifying.

639
00:20:12,200 --> 00:20:13,600
Could you take
a picture of the two of us?

640
00:20:14,480 --> 00:20:15,540
(Cui Kaiyi takes the job)
Take a picture of them.

641
00:20:15,800 --> 00:20:17,440
(Gets to work)
While we're still up here.

642
00:20:20,240 --> 00:20:21,040
You're blocking each other.

643
00:20:21,040 --> 00:20:21,760
Try this.

644
00:20:22,060 --> 00:20:23,340
(Professional repositioning)

645
00:20:23,740 --> 00:20:25,180
(The go-to pose for pictures)

646
00:20:27,120 --> 00:20:28,040
I took a hundred pictures.

647
00:20:28,040 --> 00:20:28,920
Okay, a hundred pictures.

648
00:20:28,920 --> 00:20:29,400
Thank you.

649
00:20:29,400 --> 00:20:29,880
Thanks, Cao Yiheng.

650
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:31,680
Let them count
and see if there are a hundred.

651
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:36,920
Is that a "sheep tour guide"?

652
00:20:37,440 --> 00:20:38,480
That's the "sheep tour guide".

653
00:20:39,220 --> 00:20:40,280
(Welcome, friends)

654
00:20:40,280 --> 00:20:41,050
Hello.

655
00:20:41,280 --> 00:20:41,760
Hi.

656
00:20:42,080 --> 00:20:43,880
So many sheep and cows.

657
00:20:51,560 --> 00:20:53,200
Let's take a picture.

658
00:20:53,200 --> 00:20:54,290
Two, one.

659
00:20:55,080 --> 00:20:56,480
Come on, Cao Yiheng, move over here.

660
00:20:56,760 --> 00:20:58,120
Am I looking a little too dark?

661
00:20:59,560 --> 00:21:00,760
Don't frown.

662
00:21:02,280 --> 00:21:03,760
Relax your face in a second.

663
00:21:03,760 --> 00:21:05,680
Three, two, one. Relax.

664
00:21:08,000 --> 00:21:10,600
Zhao Xilun, take a picture of us please.

665
00:21:10,600 --> 00:21:12,280
Three, two, one.

666
00:21:14,840 --> 00:21:16,600
I'll make sure to get the horses
in the background.

667
00:21:16,600 --> 00:21:18,000
Great! The vast grasslands.

668
00:21:19,520 --> 00:21:20,040
Beautiful.

669
00:21:20,320 --> 00:21:21,360
This looks really nice.

670
00:21:21,840 --> 00:21:22,880
Mini sheep.

671
00:21:22,880 --> 00:21:23,960
They're so cute.

672
00:21:23,960 --> 00:21:24,760
(Are you saying we're cute?)

673
00:21:24,760 --> 00:21:25,800
Look at me.

674
00:21:25,940 --> 00:21:26,960
(Cuddling up)

675
00:21:26,960 --> 00:21:27,840
So adorable.

676
00:21:28,360 --> 00:21:29,560
These two little lambs.

677
00:21:32,680 --> 00:21:33,960
It's licking my hand.

678
00:21:34,720 --> 00:21:36,040
Does my hand taste that good?

679
00:21:37,200 --> 00:21:38,560
Come on, sheep, follow me!

680
00:21:39,140 --> 00:21:40,740
(No sheep respond)

681
00:21:40,900 --> 00:21:42,140
(I'm coming with you)

682
00:21:42,400 --> 00:21:43,800
They all ran away.

683
00:21:44,680 --> 00:21:46,440
You're the shepherd.

684
00:21:47,540 --> 00:21:48,140
(Baa)

685
00:21:52,280 --> 00:21:53,960
Don't block Liang Xiaoyu's side.

686
00:21:54,400 --> 00:21:55,600
Will I end up in the shot?

687
00:21:55,600 --> 00:21:57,560
Don't worry, you won't.
Go ahead and take your pictures.

688
00:21:58,640 --> 00:21:59,400
So beautiful.

689
00:22:01,800 --> 00:22:03,040
Let me see.

690
00:22:04,980 --> 00:22:06,500
(Checking)

691
00:22:08,120 --> 00:22:08,920
It's a live photo.

692
00:22:08,920 --> 00:22:09,580
(Listening to Lun explain)

693
00:22:10,080 --> 00:22:11,920
Meng, I need you.

694
00:22:12,880 --> 00:22:13,960
I'm coming.

695
00:22:13,960 --> 00:22:14,800
Hold on a second.

696
00:22:15,040 --> 00:22:16,760
(One more chance)
Wait a moment.

697
00:22:17,280 --> 00:22:18,240
Don't rush.

698
00:22:18,960 --> 00:22:21,000
(Lun wants to improve)
Let me try some creative angles.

699
00:22:21,000 --> 00:22:22,160
No!

700
00:22:22,160 --> 00:22:23,160
I'll take a couple of pictures for you.

701
00:22:23,320 --> 00:22:24,560
Let me

702
00:22:24,560 --> 00:22:25,080
help you...

703
00:22:25,760 --> 00:22:26,280
Looks good.

704
00:22:27,240 --> 00:22:29,480
Your hair looks like a bird's nest.

705
00:22:29,540 --> 00:22:31,060
(Fixing his hair)

706
00:22:31,540 --> 00:22:33,260
(The stubborn bird's nest hairstyle)

707
00:22:33,600 --> 00:22:35,080
Fix your collar.

708
00:22:36,000 --> 00:22:37,280
Don't look at the camera.

709
00:22:37,280 --> 00:22:37,760
(Immediately turns away)

710
00:22:37,760 --> 00:22:38,840
Relax a little.

711
00:22:39,400 --> 00:22:40,400
You're copying me again.

712
00:22:41,180 --> 00:22:42,820
(Directing the poses)
Turn to that side.

713
00:22:43,460 --> 00:22:44,940
(Follows every direction)

714
00:22:45,480 --> 00:22:46,160
Ugly.

715
00:22:48,760 --> 00:22:49,920
If you're not cold,

716
00:22:49,920 --> 00:22:51,120
you can take your windbreaker

717
00:22:51,120 --> 00:22:52,200
off for a little while.

718
00:22:52,200 --> 00:22:53,040
I'm not cold.

719
00:22:53,280 --> 00:22:54,600
Give it to me. I'll hold it.

720
00:22:56,620 --> 00:22:58,700
(Taking the jacket)

721
00:23:01,320 --> 00:23:03,000
(With the confidence of a master)
I'm gonna take some amazing shots.

722
00:23:03,000 --> 00:23:05,080
I'll give you
that boyfriend's point of view.

723
00:23:05,080 --> 00:23:05,880
You're the girlfriend.

724
00:23:07,040 --> 00:23:07,960
Right.

725
00:23:08,440 --> 00:23:10,680
Relax and embrace nature.

726
00:23:10,760 --> 00:23:11,560
Right.

727
00:23:11,960 --> 00:23:12,840
That's it.

728
00:23:13,040 --> 00:23:14,640
Look straight ahead, just like that.

729
00:23:15,400 --> 00:23:16,200
Right.

730
00:23:16,600 --> 00:23:18,680
See if there's anything worth keeping.

731
00:23:23,440 --> 00:23:24,520
This one's pretty good, right?

732
00:23:24,520 --> 00:23:25,360
Not bad.

733
00:23:25,680 --> 00:23:29,920
I think it has
that Harper's Bazaar vibe.

734
00:23:33,080 --> 00:23:34,000
Come over here.

735
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:35,520
I'll show you how to milk a sheep.

736
00:23:35,880 --> 00:23:36,760
Like this.

737
00:23:36,760 --> 00:23:37,440
When you get to this point,

738
00:23:37,440 --> 00:23:38,520
the milk should start coming out.

739
00:23:38,520 --> 00:23:39,320
See?

740
00:23:40,280 --> 00:23:41,040
Try it yourself.

741
00:23:41,040 --> 00:23:41,960
You have to squeeze harder.

742
00:23:46,280 --> 00:23:47,600
Your turn. I can't get any milk out?

743
00:23:47,600 --> 00:23:48,400
You give it a try first.

744
00:23:50,700 --> 00:23:51,700
(Successfully milks the sheep)

745
00:23:51,720 --> 00:23:53,200
You're so good at this.

746
00:23:55,180 --> 00:23:56,620
(Shy)

747
00:23:56,920 --> 00:23:58,360
They're really milking sheep.

748
00:23:58,360 --> 00:23:58,840
Yeah.

749
00:23:59,300 --> 00:24:00,640
That looks like so much fun.

750
00:24:01,920 --> 00:24:02,560
Come on.

751
00:24:03,040 --> 00:24:03,440
Here, take my phone.

752
00:24:03,440 --> 00:24:04,680
I've already gotten quite a bit of milk.

753
00:24:04,680 --> 00:24:05,480
Let me try.

754
00:24:08,400 --> 00:24:09,600
I won't hurt it, will I?

755
00:24:10,520 --> 00:24:11,240
It's not really about the direction.

756
00:24:11,240 --> 00:24:12,200
The trick is to do it like this.

757
00:24:12,560 --> 00:24:13,080
Squeeze harder.

758
00:24:13,840 --> 00:24:14,960
I'm afraid I'll hurt it.

759
00:24:15,120 --> 00:24:15,920
Don't be afraid.

760
00:24:15,920 --> 00:24:16,860
(Encouraging)

761
00:24:17,760 --> 00:24:18,160
It's coming out.

762
00:24:18,160 --> 00:24:18,880
Did you get some?

763
00:24:19,960 --> 00:24:21,000
You did.

764
00:24:23,760 --> 00:24:24,800
This should be enough, right?

765
00:24:25,240 --> 00:24:26,920
You can go feed the baby lambs.

766
00:24:26,920 --> 00:24:27,360
Let's go.

767
00:24:27,360 --> 00:24:27,720
Come on.

768
00:24:27,960 --> 00:24:29,320
Pick a lucky one.

769
00:24:29,920 --> 00:24:30,960
We need to feed the baby lambs.

770
00:24:30,960 --> 00:24:32,000
Those two little ones.

771
00:24:32,960 --> 00:24:33,760
So cute.

772
00:24:35,280 --> 00:24:36,280
Who wants some milk?

773
00:24:37,740 --> 00:24:38,840
Let's see who wants some.

774
00:24:38,860 --> 00:24:39,860
(I want some)

775
00:24:40,240 --> 00:24:41,440
This one's for you.

776
00:24:41,440 --> 00:24:42,320
Here you go.

777
00:24:42,720 --> 00:24:43,420
It's right here.

778
00:24:43,420 --> 00:24:44,100
(Feeding the baby lamb)

779
00:24:46,620 --> 00:24:48,660
(Affectionate)

780
00:24:50,440 --> 00:24:51,440
What a waste.

781
00:24:51,440 --> 00:24:52,200
Let me try.

782
00:24:52,200 --> 00:24:53,120
I'll feed it.

783
00:24:53,120 --> 00:24:53,920
You feed them.

784
00:24:54,940 --> 00:24:56,900
(Takes over feeding duty)

785
00:25:01,600 --> 00:25:02,600
You want some too?

786
00:25:02,600 --> 00:25:03,520
No more for you.

787
00:25:04,280 --> 00:25:05,720
This one's hungry.

788
00:25:05,720 --> 00:25:06,720
It wants a sip too.

789
00:25:06,920 --> 00:25:08,200
Just one sip.

790
00:25:13,320 --> 00:25:14,200
There's no more.

791
00:25:15,640 --> 00:25:16,920
Can I hold you?

792
00:25:16,920 --> 00:25:17,840
Can I?

793
00:25:20,110 --> 00:25:20,480
Come here.

794
00:25:20,900 --> 00:25:21,480
Is that okay?

795
00:25:21,480 --> 00:25:22,280
Look at me.

796
00:25:22,280 --> 00:25:23,240
Let's take a selfie together.

797
00:25:23,800 --> 00:25:24,600
"A family of three".

798
00:25:24,820 --> 00:25:25,110
Come on.

799
00:25:26,200 --> 00:25:27,480
Move a little. I can't see it.

800
00:25:28,060 --> 00:25:32,980
(Everlasting YiHeng.
"A family of three")

801
00:25:33,200 --> 00:25:34,560
Let's take a group photo.

802
00:25:35,120 --> 00:25:35,840
Come on.

803
00:25:36,120 --> 00:25:36,840
Over here.

804
00:25:37,060 --> 00:25:37,820
(Walked past it)

805
00:25:38,340 --> 00:25:39,080
(I'm coming)

806
00:25:39,080 --> 00:25:39,600
Come on.

807
00:25:41,840 --> 00:25:42,680
Meng, come over here.

808
00:25:42,680 --> 00:25:43,520
There's still room here.

809
00:25:44,520 --> 00:25:45,040
Okay.

810
00:25:48,960 --> 00:25:50,560
We were just taking
random pictures earlier.

811
00:25:56,760 --> 00:25:59,480
Three, two, one.

812
00:26:01,600 --> 00:26:03,400
We filmed
a beach running scene in Thailand.

813
00:26:03,400 --> 00:26:04,760
Let's do one here too.

814
00:26:04,760 --> 00:26:05,520
Okay!

815
00:26:17,140 --> 00:26:18,700
(Volcano off-road vehicle group)

816
00:26:37,160 --> 00:26:37,840
Did it suddenly speed up

817
00:26:37,840 --> 00:26:39,040
because you gave it a command?

818
00:26:39,040 --> 00:26:39,560
Yeah.

819
00:26:43,100 --> 00:26:44,220
(Jiu?)

820
00:26:44,240 --> 00:26:44,800
Their command

821
00:26:44,800 --> 00:26:45,840
is "jiu".

822
00:26:47,840 --> 00:26:49,160
You're killing me!

823
00:26:52,940 --> 00:26:55,300
(Wants to join)

824
00:26:55,540 --> 00:26:56,320
(That "jiu" really works)

825
00:26:56,320 --> 00:26:57,240
Can you sit, babe?

826
00:26:57,960 --> 00:26:58,680
But this horse

827
00:26:58,680 --> 00:26:59,670
is pretty slow.

828
00:27:00,400 --> 00:27:01,080
When we get down there,

829
00:27:01,080 --> 00:27:01,920
we'll switch.

830
00:27:01,920 --> 00:27:02,120
Sure.

831
00:27:02,120 --> 00:27:02,600
You ride this one.

832
00:27:04,240 --> 00:27:05,040
Get off.

833
00:27:06,040 --> 00:27:06,560
Come on down.

834
00:27:06,560 --> 00:27:07,660
(Helps hold the horse)

835
00:27:07,720 --> 00:27:08,400
Get down.

836
00:27:09,760 --> 00:27:10,160
Get on over there.

837
00:27:10,160 --> 00:27:10,560
Mount from here.

838
00:27:11,200 --> 00:27:12,600
Don't walk behind it.

839
00:27:12,600 --> 00:27:13,400
(Reminds)
Go around the front.

840
00:27:15,120 --> 00:27:15,680
This way.

841
00:27:16,800 --> 00:27:17,200
Come on.

842
00:27:20,720 --> 00:27:21,640
Okay, hold it.

843
00:27:21,660 --> 00:27:22,980
(Hands it over)

844
00:27:25,920 --> 00:27:26,360
Go.

845
00:27:32,600 --> 00:27:33,400
Squeeze with your legs.

846
00:27:42,240 --> 00:27:43,240
Babe, you look so cool!

847
00:27:50,640 --> 00:27:51,360
Babe, look.

848
00:27:52,400 --> 00:27:53,160
So beautiful.

849
00:27:58,540 --> 00:28:00,060
(Won't budge)

850
00:28:00,080 --> 00:28:00,800
Go!

851
00:28:00,800 --> 00:28:04,820
(Professional instructor present.
Don't try this.)

852
00:28:04,840 --> 00:28:05,280
Wake up.

853
00:28:06,640 --> 00:28:07,680
I think it's just waiting
for the other one to graze.

854
00:28:09,240 --> 00:28:09,840
Are you waiting

855
00:28:09,840 --> 00:28:10,840
for your buddy to eat?

856
00:28:10,840 --> 00:28:11,720
(Interviews the horse)

857
00:28:11,720 --> 00:28:12,560
Have some too.

858
00:28:12,560 --> 00:28:13,660
(Help yourself)

859
00:28:16,760 --> 00:28:17,440
Let me take some pictures.

860
00:28:22,800 --> 00:28:23,880
My horse is mad.

861
00:28:27,120 --> 00:28:28,880
Pull back!

862
00:28:28,880 --> 00:28:29,600
Pull it!

863
00:28:32,320 --> 00:28:33,160
Help!

864
00:28:34,240 --> 00:28:35,720
That one's acting up.

865
00:28:35,980 --> 00:28:37,500
(Helping from afar)

866
00:28:38,720 --> 00:28:39,960
I dropped my phone!

867
00:28:40,880 --> 00:28:42,000
It's okay. Leave it for now.

868
00:28:45,280 --> 00:28:46,160
How'd it go?

869
00:28:46,160 --> 00:28:47,360
That was terrifying!

870
00:28:47,360 --> 00:28:48,560
It started running!

871
00:28:48,560 --> 00:28:49,160
It's okay.

872
00:28:49,160 --> 00:28:50,360
It suddenly took off!

873
00:28:51,360 --> 00:28:52,120
What happened, Fang?

874
00:28:52,720 --> 00:28:54,560
(Concerned)
That was so scary!

875
00:28:54,560 --> 00:28:56,360
It suddenly took off!

876
00:28:56,360 --> 00:28:57,680
Why don't you switch to this one?

877
00:28:57,680 --> 00:28:58,440
It's gentler.

878
00:28:58,440 --> 00:28:58,800
I'll take that one.

879
00:28:58,800 --> 00:28:59,880
This one's really gentle, Fang.

880
00:28:59,880 --> 00:29:01,120
Why don't you ride this one?

881
00:29:01,120 --> 00:29:01,720
Okay, thanks.

882
00:29:03,880 --> 00:29:04,600
Hey, man.

883
00:29:04,600 --> 00:29:05,400
Can you grab

884
00:29:05,400 --> 00:29:06,520
my phone for me?

885
00:29:07,080 --> 00:29:07,600
Thanks.

886
00:29:09,880 --> 00:29:11,360
Xing, you're really good at this.

887
00:29:11,360 --> 00:29:12,720
Did you take lessons too?

888
00:29:12,720 --> 00:29:13,880
I took lessons with him.

889
00:29:14,680 --> 00:29:15,360
When?

890
00:29:15,360 --> 00:29:16,560
A while ago.

891
00:29:16,560 --> 00:29:17,080
Wow.

892
00:29:17,960 --> 00:29:19,560
This one's definitely much gentler.

893
00:29:21,280 --> 00:29:22,080
That's good.

894
00:29:23,480 --> 00:29:25,600
Babe, wait for me.

895
00:29:25,600 --> 00:29:26,040
Okay.

896
00:29:28,040 --> 00:29:28,760
So beautiful.

897
00:29:36,480 --> 00:29:37,280
Chen Hewen is here.

898
00:29:37,280 --> 00:29:38,620
(Taking it easy)

899
00:29:38,720 --> 00:29:39,600
Come on.

900
00:29:57,360 --> 00:29:58,160
This feels amazing!

901
00:30:16,760 --> 00:30:17,520
So beautiful.

902
00:30:17,920 --> 00:30:18,720
I'm so happy.

903
00:30:20,800 --> 00:30:22,400
The lighting's gorgeous.

904
00:30:22,400 --> 00:30:23,400
Are you guys hungry?

905
00:30:23,400 --> 00:30:24,360
Let's go eat.

906
00:30:24,360 --> 00:30:25,040
Let's go!

907
00:30:25,040 --> 00:30:25,440
Come on.

908
00:30:32,160 --> 00:30:33,240
We're here.

909
00:30:35,360 --> 00:30:37,160
Look at that yurt. It's so pretty!

910
00:30:37,440 --> 00:30:38,120
Babe, look!

911
00:30:38,120 --> 00:30:38,840
Take a picture.

912
00:30:38,840 --> 00:30:39,400
Where?

913
00:30:39,960 --> 00:30:40,880
It's huge.

914
00:30:41,160 --> 00:30:41,840
Let's go.

915
00:30:42,560 --> 00:30:43,160
Come on!

916
00:30:43,160 --> 00:30:43,960
Let's get down.

917
00:30:46,280 --> 00:30:47,640
Hi!

918
00:30:47,840 --> 00:30:49,840
Hi!

919
00:30:49,840 --> 00:30:50,760
Was it fun?

920
00:30:50,760 --> 00:30:51,440
Yeah, it was.

921
00:30:51,440 --> 00:30:52,240
How was yours?

922
00:30:52,240 --> 00:30:53,280
Ours was fun too.

923
00:30:53,560 --> 00:30:54,440
What did you guys do?

924
00:30:54,440 --> 00:30:55,280
We cuddled lambs.

925
00:30:55,280 --> 00:30:56,120
And rode horses.

926
00:30:56,120 --> 00:30:57,720
We rode horses and cuddled lambs.

927
00:30:59,560 --> 00:31:01,120
Someone's welcoming us!

928
00:31:01,680 --> 00:31:05,760
♪Friends from afar♪

929
00:31:05,760 --> 00:31:09,160
♪You've had a long journey♪

930
00:31:10,160 --> 00:31:16,000
♪Have a welcome drink♪

931
00:31:16,920 --> 00:31:18,000
It's so pretty.

932
00:31:18,000 --> 00:31:19,240
It's really beautiful.

933
00:31:20,480 --> 00:31:21,520
(Presents a ceremonial scarf)
Thank you.

934
00:31:21,520 --> 00:31:22,680
Thank you.

935
00:31:22,680 --> 00:31:23,240
Thanks.

936
00:31:23,240 --> 00:31:23,960
Thank you.

937
00:31:26,120 --> 00:31:26,920
Thank you.

938
00:31:27,080 --> 00:31:27,880
Thanks.

939
00:31:27,980 --> 00:31:29,320
(Offers a drink)

940
00:31:29,320 --> 00:31:29,960
Okay.

941
00:31:30,480 --> 00:31:31,560
Thank you.

942
00:31:32,160 --> 00:31:33,120
(No alcohol for minors)
Is it alcohol?

943
00:31:33,120 --> 00:31:34,040
Be careful.

944
00:31:34,040 --> 00:31:35,220
(Welcome wine is a traditional Mongolian
honor for distinguished guests)

945
00:31:35,220 --> 00:31:36,340
(The wine symbolizes peace,
good luck, and prosperity)

946
00:31:36,360 --> 00:31:37,080
Wanna try some?

947
00:31:37,640 --> 00:31:38,760
You drink it.

948
00:31:40,600 --> 00:31:41,200
Bottoms up.

949
00:31:45,520 --> 00:31:47,440
Everyone can head
into the yurt for dinner.

950
00:31:47,440 --> 00:31:48,440
Let's go.

951
00:31:49,680 --> 00:31:50,840
Let's go eat.

952
00:32:04,720 --> 00:32:06,120
I'll sit here.

953
00:32:08,560 --> 00:32:09,520
Cui Yihang, sitting here?

954
00:32:09,520 --> 00:32:10,480
I'll sit here.

955
00:32:10,480 --> 00:32:11,360
Sure.

956
00:32:11,880 --> 00:32:14,600
Then this seat's perfect for you.

957
00:32:15,120 --> 00:32:16,120
Okay.

958
00:32:18,520 --> 00:32:19,880
So much dried fruit.

959
00:32:20,940 --> 00:32:22,190
(Mongolian feasts feature white foods
like dairy, dried fruit, and pastries)

960
00:32:22,190 --> 00:32:23,260
(And red foods, including meat
and whole roast lamb)

961
00:32:23,270 --> 00:32:24,260
(White foods come first,
symbolizing abundance)

962
00:32:24,520 --> 00:32:25,480
What's this?

963
00:32:26,620 --> 00:32:27,100
(Ulanqab roasted potatoes
and potato tarts)

964
00:32:27,100 --> 00:32:27,540
(Ulanqab is China's potato capital)

965
00:32:27,540 --> 00:32:27,980
(Its 41°N plateau climate
and sandy soil)

966
00:32:27,980 --> 00:32:28,680
(Give its potatoes a unique texture)
Roasted potatoes?

967
00:32:28,680 --> 00:32:29,520
(Often served with dairy and lamb)
Potatoes?

968
00:32:29,520 --> 00:32:30,560
Looks delicious.

969
00:32:30,560 --> 00:32:31,720
Yours collapsed.

970
00:32:31,720 --> 00:32:33,080
Mine's all puffed up.

971
00:32:33,660 --> 00:32:34,110
(Modern-style Hailama)

972
00:32:34,110 --> 00:32:34,910
(A layer of milk skin sits on top.
Break it open with a spoon)

973
00:32:34,910 --> 00:32:35,440
(And mix it
with the milk custard underneath)

974
00:32:35,450 --> 00:32:35,980
(Rich and creamy, it's a white food)

975
00:32:36,320 --> 00:32:37,680
Mine's puffed up too.

976
00:32:43,780 --> 00:32:45,860
(Ode to the Whole Lamb)

977
00:32:47,860 --> 00:32:50,430
(Song's meaning: Heaven blesses us
with a plump lamb)

978
00:32:50,430 --> 00:32:52,670
(Offered to our
honored guests from afar)

979
00:32:52,670 --> 00:32:57,850
(Roasted over fire,
its aroma fills the vast grasslands)

980
00:32:57,880 --> 00:32:59,280
Your favorite roast lamb!

981
00:32:59,280 --> 00:33:01,280
(The whole lamb symbolizes
good fortune and health)

982
00:33:01,280 --> 00:33:03,280
(May this grassland feast
bring abundance every year)

983
00:33:03,280 --> 00:33:05,280
(Thriving herds, happy families,
and success in all things)

984
00:33:05,280 --> 00:33:07,280
(We offer this traditional
grassland dish to our honored guests)

985
00:33:07,280 --> 00:33:09,280
(The lamb embodies the land's
bounty and Mongolian hospitality)

986
00:33:09,280 --> 00:33:10,980
(Cheers to good weather,
blessings, and lasting friendship)

987
00:33:13,480 --> 00:33:15,520
Dear honored guests,

988
00:33:15,520 --> 00:33:16,560
good evening, everyone!

989
00:33:16,560 --> 00:33:17,920
Welcome to the beautiful foothills

990
00:33:17,920 --> 00:33:20,120
of Ulanhad Volcanos!

991
00:33:20,120 --> 00:33:21,640
Now, let's invite

992
00:33:21,640 --> 00:33:23,800
our honored guests

993
00:33:23,800 --> 00:33:26,080
onstage for the roast lamb ceremony.

994
00:33:26,560 --> 00:33:27,480
Please come up.

995
00:33:30,720 --> 00:33:31,520
These two guests.

996
00:33:32,360 --> 00:33:33,600
You two go up.

997
00:33:33,600 --> 00:33:35,440
I'll pick two more.

998
00:33:36,240 --> 00:33:37,240
You two, please.

999
00:33:39,200 --> 00:33:40,000
Okay.

1000
00:33:40,000 --> 00:33:41,960
Come onstage for today's
roast lamb ceremony.

1001
00:33:46,480 --> 00:33:47,800
Let's go.

1002
00:33:50,840 --> 00:33:51,360
Come on.

1003
00:33:52,530 --> 00:33:53,160
You two.

1004
00:33:53,240 --> 00:33:53,960
Yes.

1005
00:33:53,960 --> 00:33:54,840
Both together.

1006
00:33:55,080 --> 00:33:55,840
Make the ceremonial cut.

1007
00:33:57,240 --> 00:33:57,920
Here.

1008
00:33:57,920 --> 00:33:58,320
Right.

1009
00:33:58,320 --> 00:33:59,460
(Guest uses a Mongolian knife)
Let's carve the lamb!

1010
00:33:59,480 --> 00:34:00,720
(To cut a cross on the lamb's back)
Here, right.

1011
00:34:00,720 --> 00:34:01,980
(Symbolizing perfection)
Good.

1012
00:34:02,320 --> 00:34:04,320
Why does this feel like a wedding?

1013
00:34:04,660 --> 00:34:06,380
(Capturing the moment)

1014
00:34:06,400 --> 00:34:07,480
Cut a cross

1015
00:34:07,480 --> 00:34:08,480
on the lamb's back.

1016
00:34:10,840 --> 00:34:11,960
Great. The lamb's ready.

1017
00:34:11,960 --> 00:34:12,680
We wish

1018
00:34:12,680 --> 00:34:14,600
all ethnic groups happiness and health.

1019
00:34:14,600 --> 00:34:16,200
Now, may our honored guests

1020
00:34:16,200 --> 00:34:17,800
accept this bowl

1021
00:34:18,400 --> 00:34:19,320
of fine wine!

1022
00:34:22,060 --> 00:34:22,580
(No alcohol for minors)

1023
00:34:22,600 --> 00:34:23,640
(Guests are offered drinks after
the Zhama feast's roast lamb ceremony)

1024
00:34:23,640 --> 00:34:24,480
(Symbolizing acceptance
of the grasslands' highest honor)

1025
00:34:37,560 --> 00:34:38,200
Let's eat!

1026
00:34:38,200 --> 00:34:38,840
Come on.

1027
00:34:38,840 --> 00:34:39,680
Dig in!

1028
00:34:39,840 --> 00:34:42,120
Let's all have a drink together.

1029
00:34:42,400 --> 00:34:43,280
Come on, a toast.

1030
00:34:43,280 --> 00:34:45,400
Yu Yang, say a few words.

1031
00:34:45,400 --> 00:34:46,080
Welcome, everyone,

1032
00:34:46,080 --> 00:34:47,600
to Inner Mongolia!

1033
00:34:47,760 --> 00:34:48,120
Everyone...

1034
00:34:48,120 --> 00:34:49,600
Eat and drink up.

1035
00:34:50,080 --> 00:34:50,560
Cheers!

1036
00:34:50,880 --> 00:34:51,480
Cheers!

1037
00:34:51,820 --> 00:34:56,580
(No alcohol for minors)

1038
00:34:56,600 --> 00:34:57,600
Yu Yang, you sound

1039
00:34:57,600 --> 00:34:59,120
like you're from Inner Mongolia.

1040
00:34:59,560 --> 00:35:01,280
Like you're hosting us.

1041
00:35:01,280 --> 00:35:02,720
You're from Inner Mongolia, right?

1042
00:35:02,720 --> 00:35:03,960
We're eating at Yu Yang's place.

1043
00:35:04,920 --> 00:35:06,200
Welcome home, everyone.

1044
00:35:08,040 --> 00:35:09,400
It really does feel like home.

1045
00:35:09,720 --> 00:35:11,000
Having everyone together

1046
00:35:11,000 --> 00:35:11,600
feels just like home.

1047
00:35:11,600 --> 00:35:14,220
(Being together feels just like home)

1048
00:35:14,940 --> 00:35:16,100
(Glances)
Cheers.

1049
00:35:18,360 --> 00:35:19,800
Welcome to Ulanqab.

1050
00:35:20,320 --> 00:35:21,480
Stay happy every day.

1051
00:35:21,480 --> 00:35:22,080
You too.

1052
00:35:22,260 --> 00:35:24,700
(Glasses getting lower and lower)

1053
00:35:25,080 --> 00:35:25,760
The first time

1054
00:35:25,760 --> 00:35:27,760
we entered the house,

1055
00:35:27,760 --> 00:35:28,680
when we clinked bottles,

1056
00:35:29,120 --> 00:35:30,080
mine was down here.

1057
00:35:31,020 --> 00:35:32,300
(Bursts out laughing)

1058
00:35:32,400 --> 00:35:33,400
Nice to meet you all.

1059
00:35:34,020 --> 00:35:35,340
(Clinks bottles near the floor)

1060
00:35:35,800 --> 00:35:37,120
I was so weird back then.

1061
00:35:38,600 --> 00:35:39,840
Like, who's this weirdo

1062
00:35:39,840 --> 00:35:40,560
clinking bottles with you like that?

1063
00:35:43,120 --> 00:35:44,040
Try the egg tart.

1064
00:35:44,720 --> 00:35:45,480
I did.

1065
00:35:45,480 --> 00:35:46,160
It's not an egg tart.

1066
00:35:46,160 --> 00:35:47,160
It's filled with mashed potatoes.

1067
00:35:47,160 --> 00:35:48,280
It's pretty good. Try it.

1068
00:35:48,960 --> 00:35:49,780
Then you can have it.

1069
00:35:49,820 --> 00:35:50,720
(Offers it)
No.

1070
00:35:50,720 --> 00:35:51,240
I already had one.

1071
00:35:51,240 --> 00:35:51,640
That's too much.

1072
00:35:51,860 --> 00:35:52,340
(Glances)

1073
00:35:53,480 --> 00:35:54,560
This is beef, babe.

1074
00:35:54,560 --> 00:35:55,880
Here, have some beef.

1075
00:35:55,880 --> 00:35:56,920
I've already got so much food.

1076
00:35:56,920 --> 00:35:58,120
You eat the beef.

1077
00:35:58,560 --> 00:36:00,080
Can you eat beef tendon, babe?

1078
00:36:00,080 --> 00:36:00,560
No, thanks.

1079
00:36:00,560 --> 00:36:01,320
You have it.

1080
00:36:02,440 --> 00:36:02,920
Babe, have you

1081
00:36:02,920 --> 00:36:03,600
finished your yogurt?

1082
00:36:04,120 --> 00:36:04,760
Not yet.

1083
00:36:04,760 --> 00:36:05,880
Hurry and drink it.

1084
00:36:06,280 --> 00:36:07,120
Go on, drink it.

1085
00:36:07,120 --> 00:36:08,080
(Offers it)
Help digest

1086
00:36:08,080 --> 00:36:08,560
all that meat.

1087
00:36:08,560 --> 00:36:09,880
You drink it.

1088
00:36:09,880 --> 00:36:10,840
Here you go.

1089
00:36:10,840 --> 00:36:12,240
You have it.

1090
00:36:12,980 --> 00:36:13,620
(So much love from "babe")

1091
00:36:13,640 --> 00:36:14,240
I've got some.

1092
00:36:14,240 --> 00:36:15,080
Go ahead. It's fine.

1093
00:36:15,080 --> 00:36:15,880
Take your time.

1094
00:36:18,760 --> 00:36:20,160
So what did the volcano look like?

1095
00:36:21,300 --> 00:36:22,220
(Curious)

1096
00:36:22,360 --> 00:36:23,480
It's basically a crater.

1097
00:36:23,480 --> 00:36:26,480
Like a raised mound with a hole.

1098
00:36:26,720 --> 00:36:28,400
Was it gray

1099
00:36:28,400 --> 00:36:29,840
or green?

1100
00:36:29,840 --> 00:36:30,760
Green.

1101
00:36:30,760 --> 00:36:31,160
Yeah.

1102
00:36:31,280 --> 00:36:32,000
Covered in grass?

1103
00:36:32,000 --> 00:36:32,910
Yeah.

1104
00:36:33,520 --> 00:36:34,560
Right?

1105
00:36:35,040 --> 00:36:35,440
No.

1106
00:36:35,650 --> 00:36:36,140
No.

1107
00:36:36,360 --> 00:36:37,080
Really?

1108
00:36:37,080 --> 00:36:37,640
No.

1109
00:36:38,440 --> 00:36:39,130
It's

1110
00:36:39,320 --> 00:36:40,520
covered in volcanic rock.

1111
00:36:40,520 --> 00:36:41,600
Black rock.

1112
00:36:41,600 --> 00:36:42,640
Did you guys even go to the same place,

1113
00:36:42,640 --> 00:36:43,520
guys?

1114
00:36:44,200 --> 00:36:45,320
But I remember

1115
00:36:45,320 --> 00:36:47,320
the crater might've been gray.

1116
00:36:47,320 --> 00:36:48,000
You know...

1117
00:36:48,000 --> 00:36:48,680
Got it.

1118
00:36:48,680 --> 00:36:50,640
But it was all green below.

1119
00:36:50,640 --> 00:36:52,120
So what else did you guys

1120
00:36:52,120 --> 00:36:53,520
do at the volcano?

1121
00:36:53,520 --> 00:36:54,520
Horseback riding.

1122
00:36:54,780 --> 00:36:55,560
We rode horses too!

1123
00:36:55,560 --> 00:36:56,400
Me too!

1124
00:36:56,400 --> 00:36:57,720
We even galloped!

1125
00:36:57,920 --> 00:36:59,080
So did we!

1126
00:37:00,040 --> 00:37:01,040
I was bouncing all over!

1127
00:37:01,040 --> 00:37:02,120
Up and down like this!

1128
00:37:02,120 --> 00:37:03,280
Its legs were moving

1129
00:37:03,280 --> 00:37:05,000
in pairs like this!

1130
00:37:05,000 --> 00:37:06,640
Sun Bohan led us on a run.

1131
00:37:07,280 --> 00:37:08,120
A real pro.

1132
00:37:08,760 --> 00:37:10,000
We've got our coach right here.

1133
00:37:10,000 --> 00:37:11,080
Love coach.

1134
00:37:11,400 --> 00:37:12,880
Love coach!

1135
00:37:13,520 --> 00:37:14,440
Alright, let me ask

1136
00:37:14,440 --> 00:37:15,240
our honored guests.

1137
00:37:15,240 --> 00:37:16,560
How's the food?

1138
00:37:16,560 --> 00:37:17,360
Is it good?

1139
00:37:17,360 --> 00:37:18,160
Delicious!

1140
00:37:18,160 --> 00:37:18,880
So good!

1141
00:37:18,880 --> 00:37:20,360
Is everything to your liking?

1142
00:37:20,360 --> 00:37:20,720
Yes!

1143
00:37:20,720 --> 00:37:21,520
Absolutely!

1144
00:37:21,520 --> 00:37:21,840
Great.

1145
00:37:21,840 --> 00:37:23,440
That's a relief.

1146
00:37:23,440 --> 00:37:24,600
We've also prepared

1147
00:37:24,600 --> 00:37:25,840
a special grassland blessing

1148
00:37:25,840 --> 00:37:26,880
