1149
00:37:26,880 --> 00:37:28,720
Here's Ode to the White Horse.

1150
00:37:30,040 --> 00:37:31,720
Will there be throat singing later?

1151
00:37:34,160 --> 00:37:34,680
So bright.

1152
00:37:37,800 --> 00:37:38,640
It's so bright.

1153
00:37:40,580 --> 00:37:45,340
(Ode to the White Horse)

1154
00:37:45,470 --> 00:37:51,470
(Song's meaning: A white horse
grows strong on lush grasslands)

1155
00:37:51,470 --> 00:37:55,470
(Generations of horsemen
carry on their legacy)

1156
00:37:55,470 --> 00:37:59,470
(Through wind, frost, rain,
and snow, hooves thunder)

1157
00:37:59,470 --> 00:38:03,470
(Faithful companions
to herders through the years)

1158
00:38:03,470 --> 00:38:07,470
(Old herding songs echo
as horses race across the plains)

1159
00:38:07,470 --> 00:38:11,470
(Strong horses once carried
the burden of daily work)

1160
00:38:11,470 --> 00:38:15,470
(Hardworking and resilient,
never forgetting their roots)

1161
00:38:15,470 --> 00:38:19,470
(The spirit of the Mongolian horse
lives in our hearts)

1162
00:38:19,470 --> 00:38:23,470
(Eight mighty steeds
gallop across the vast land)

1163
00:38:23,470 --> 00:38:27,470
(The majestic white horse
shines across the grasslands)

1164
00:38:27,470 --> 00:38:31,470
(Chasing wind and moonlight,
brave and strong)

1165
00:38:31,480 --> 00:38:36,980
(The people of the grasslands
will sing your praises forever)

1166
00:38:51,040 --> 00:38:52,440
