1177
00:39:48,560 --> 00:39:50,320
They're amazing!

1178
00:39:53,320 --> 00:40:01,440
Fang!

1179
00:40:09,400 --> 00:40:10,000
Thank you.

1180
00:40:10,000 --> 00:40:15,280
Fang!

1181
00:40:16,000 --> 00:40:17,200
That was amazing!

1182
00:40:18,000 --> 00:40:19,200
Now, how about

1183
00:40:19,200 --> 00:40:20,760
