1184
00:40:20,760 --> 00:40:21,160
Sure.

1185
00:40:21,160 --> 00:40:21,800
Let's play a game!

1186
00:40:25,520 --> 00:40:26,720
You were drop-dead gorgeous, Fang!

1187
00:40:28,640 --> 00:40:31,640
Absolutely gorgeous!

1188
00:40:31,840 --> 00:40:32,680
Now, let's

1189
00:40:32,680 --> 00:40:34,200
