1359
00:47:07,400 --> 00:47:10,720
♪You cried and told me♪

1360
00:47:10,720 --> 00:47:11,880
♪That fairy tales♪

1361
00:47:11,880 --> 00:47:12,280
That's right!

1362
00:47:12,280 --> 00:47:14,240
