1363
00:47:14,240 --> 00:47:15,560
Sounds great!

1364
00:47:15,560 --> 00:47:16,720
So good!

1365
00:47:16,720 --> 00:47:18,000
♪Since you loved me♪

1366
00:47:18,000 --> 00:47:20,080
