♪Have all lit up♪

1369
00:47:29,160 --> 00:47:30,280
So cute!

1370
00:47:30,880 --> 00:47:32,360
Sounds great!

1371
00:47:32,680 --> 00:47:34,360
♪Believe that we♪

1372
00:47:34,360 --> 00:47:37,160
