1394
00:48:43,440 --> 00:48:44,840
Yeah, wrong direction!

1395
00:48:46,560 --> 00:48:47,200
This is awesome.

1396
00:48:48,080 --> 00:48:49,560
Our Zhama feast

1397
00:48:49,560 --> 00:48:51,080
