Chen Hewen? Okay!

1415
00:49:29,720 --> 00:49:30,280
Chen Hewen.

1416
00:49:30,280 --> 00:49:31,520
Okay, Chen Hewen!

1417
00:49:31,760 --> 00:49:33,000
Chen Hewen.

1418
