1426
00:49:55,040 --> 00:49:58,000
This is definitely
the wildest hairstyle this season.

1427
00:50:00,400 --> 00:50:01,080
Number one.

1428
00:50:01,080 --> 00:50:01,920
"Hi My Sweetheart."

1429
00:50:02,400 --> 00:50:03,320
