1440
00:50:19,560 --> 00:50:20,120
Totally.

1441
00:50:20,120 --> 00:50:21,560
I couldn't even hear how I sounded.

1442
00:50:22,160 --> 00:50:23,080
You were on-key.

1443
00:50:23,080 --> 00:50:24,000
We heard you.

1444
