1452
00:50:40,920 --> 00:50:41,360
Yeah.

1453
00:50:41,800 --> 00:50:43,440
(I get what you mean)
The rest was pretty okay.

1454
00:50:44,720 --> 00:50:45,800
But that first line...

1455
00:50:47,600 --> 00:50:48,400
You...

1456
00:50:54,200 --> 00:50:55,200
I'm so bright.

1457
00:50:55,260 --> 00:50:56,900
(Cute)

1458
00:51:01,440 --> 00:51:02,240
Use these.

1459
00:51:06,500 --> 00:51:07,660
(Sunglasses to block the light)

1460
00:51:07,680 --> 00:51:08,480
Genius.

1461
00:51:09,360 --> 00:51:14,400
Okay.

1462
00:51:14,400 --> 00:51:16,040
Now I can sleep.

1463
00:51:22,920 --> 00:51:23,800
Get some sleep.

1464
00:51:24,600 --> 00:51:25,480
Go to sleep.

1465
00:51:32,920 --> 00:51:34,480
Something just hit me.

1466
00:51:35,160 --> 00:51:37,240
After this trip,

1467
00:51:37,240 --> 00:51:38,280
who knows when

1468
00:51:38,280 --> 00:51:39,280
