1469
00:51:43,040 --> 00:51:44,360
We'll find time.

1470
00:51:45,400 --> 00:51:46,360
It's just hard.

1471
00:51:47,040 --> 00:51:47,880
Like, next time,

1472
00:51:47,880 --> 00:51:49,440
