1473
00:51:51,480 --> 00:51:53,240
Zhao Xilun might already be overseas.

1474
00:51:53,840 --> 00:51:56,600
And Fang will be on tour.

1475
00:51:56,960 --> 00:51:58,360
We'll never get everyone together.

1476
00:52:01,960 --> 00:52:03,120
Everyone's just too busy.

1477
00:52:03,480 --> 00:52:04,400
It's not that we don't want to.

1478
00:52:04,400 --> 00:52:05,720
We just won't get the chance.

1479
00:52:13,280 --> 00:52:15,680
We could always

1480
