1481
00:52:17,800 --> 00:52:19,360
We could even take a group photo.

1482
00:52:19,360 --> 00:52:19,680
Yeah.

1483
00:52:19,680 --> 00:52:21,240
We could do it online.

1484
00:52:21,600 --> 00:52:22,360
But really,

1485
00:52:22,360 --> 00:52:23,400
