1487
00:52:24,680 --> 00:52:26,240
Of course it isn't.

1488
00:52:28,400 --> 00:52:30,240
How do you wanna celebrate
your birthday, Liang Xiaoyu?

1489
00:52:30,240 --> 00:52:31,680
I can celebrate with you.

1490
00:52:32,160 --> 00:52:32,640
Sure.

1491
00:52:33,320 --> 00:52:34,640
Let me think. My birthday

1492
00:52:34,640 --> 00:52:36,200
