1493
00:52:36,520 --> 00:52:37,440
And during Lunar New Year,

1494
00:52:37,440 --> 00:52:39,320
I can get to your place in just an hour.

1495
00:52:40,320 --> 00:52:41,040
That's hilarious!

1496
00:52:41,040 --> 00:52:43,200
Don't you think that's really funny?

1497
00:52:43,200 --> 00:52:44,400
That's great.

1498
00:52:44,400 --> 00:52:45,960
It's the 11th day of the lunar new year.

1499
00:52:45,960 --> 00:52:46,960
That's not too bad.

1500
00:52:46,960 --> 00:52:47,640
The holiday will be over.

1501
00:52:47,640 --> 00:52:49,000
Yeah, the 11th day.

1502
00:52:49,480 --> 00:52:50,200
There's still hope.

1503
00:52:50,200 --> 00:52:51,000
Still hope.

1504
00:52:53,200 --> 00:52:54,200
So cute.

1505
00:52:55,840 --> 00:52:56,920
We're here.

1506
00:52:56,920 --> 00:52:58,400
Let's head back.

1507
00:52:59,880 --> 00:53:00,680
Let's get out.

1508
00:53:02,120 --> 00:53:03,040
It's so cold!

1509
00:53:03,500 --> 00:53:05,420
