1510
00:53:07,600 --> 00:53:08,920
Let's head home first.

1511
00:53:09,680 --> 00:53:10,760
Whose place first?

1512
00:53:10,760 --> 00:53:11,800
Mine.

1513
00:53:12,200 --> 00:53:13,240
You're coming to my place too?

1514
00:53:13,240 --> 00:53:13,840
Sure.

1515
00:53:15,080 --> 00:53:17,080
I'm gonna head back and sleep, guys.

1516
00:53:17,080 --> 00:53:18,600
Don't forget your cold medicine.

1517
00:53:18,600 --> 00:53:19,200
Okay.

1518
00:53:19,220 --> 00:53:21,420
