1523
00:53:31,320 --> 00:53:32,120
Let's go.

1524
00:53:32,840 --> 00:53:34,680
I'm leaving!

1525
00:53:36,760 --> 00:53:38,000
I'm leaving too.

1526
00:53:38,560 --> 00:53:40,120
I've got performances coming up.

1527
00:53:40,120 --> 00:53:41,840
