1528
00:53:41,840 --> 00:53:44,480
I'm getting anxious.
I've got separation anxiety.

1529
00:53:45,040 --> 00:53:46,080
What am I gonna do?

1530
00:53:46,080 --> 00:53:47,680
Aren't you used to this by now?

1531
00:53:48,640 --> 00:53:49,640
No, I'm not!

1532
00:53:49,640 --> 00:53:50,880
I've got separation anxiety!

1533
00:53:50,880 --> 00:53:51,720
There's the time difference too.

1534
00:53:52,000 --> 00:53:52,840
But it's okay.

1535
00:53:52,840 --> 00:53:53,840
The time difference

1536
00:53:53,840 --> 00:53:54,920
