1537
00:53:55,120 --> 00:53:56,280
You're going to America.

1538
00:53:59,720 --> 00:54:01,360
I'll be back on the 30th.

1539
00:54:01,360 --> 00:54:02,400
Eight days, yeah.

1540
00:54:03,080 --> 00:54:04,120
That's not just a few days.

1541
00:54:09,320 --> 00:54:10,840
What am I gonna do?

1542
00:54:11,600 --> 00:54:16,040
I'm doomed!

1543
00:54:16,040 --> 00:54:16,720
You're not doomed.

1544
00:54:16,720 --> 00:54:17,840
What's so bad about it?

1545
00:54:20,000 --> 00:54:21,560
So tomorrow...

1546
00:54:21,800 --> 00:54:22,800
I'm leaving the day after.

1547
00:54:22,800 --> 00:54:23,400
So annoying.

1548
00:54:24,160 --> 00:54:25,000
So

1549
00:54:25,000 --> 00:54:26,080
you'll only be back for a day

1550
00:54:26,080 --> 00:54:26,960
before another work trip.

1551
00:54:26,960 --> 00:54:28,920
Yeah, I'll be away for a while.

1552
00:54:30,680 --> 00:54:31,560
It's okay.

1553
00:54:31,560 --> 00:54:32,600
Even our...

1554
00:54:33,480 --> 00:54:35,400
Didn't we plan something
for our 100th day?

1555
00:54:38,040 --> 00:54:39,480
Guess we won't have time.

1556
00:54:41,280 --> 00:54:42,720
Then let's celebrate 200 days.

1557
00:54:46,320 --> 00:54:47,880
I'll probably be back by the 5th or 6th.

1558
00:54:47,880 --> 00:54:49,000
October 5th or 6th.

1559
00:54:52,080 --> 00:54:53,720
I'll be free then.

1560
00:54:55,600 --> 00:54:57,240
I'll see if I can go with you

1561
00:54:59,600 --> 00:55:00,560
Disneyland

1562
