Sound good?

1564
00:55:06,120 --> 00:55:06,520
Sure.

1565
00:55:06,840 --> 00:55:07,840
That's what I was thinking too.

1566
00:55:19,920 --> 00:55:21,440
Let's wish that we never fight.

1567
00:55:22,440 --> 00:55:23,280
We won't.

1568
00:55:26,200 --> 00:55:27,400
Whoever starts a fight is a puppy.

1569
00:55:35,880 --> 00:55:36,720
Whoever starts a fight

1570
00:55:36,720 --> 00:55:37,680
