1571
00:55:40,440 --> 00:55:41,920
I'd actually love to be Sparkle.

1572
00:55:42,400 --> 00:55:43,320
Sparkle's adorable!

1573
00:55:43,560 --> 00:55:44,440
Then you can start right now.

1574
00:55:44,440 --> 00:55:45,080
Pick something else.

1575
00:55:45,200 --> 00:55:45,720
Something else.

1576
00:55:46,280 --> 00:55:47,960
Whoever starts a fight becomes...

1577
00:55:54,900 --> 00:55:55,900
(Imitates)

1578
00:56:01,200 --> 00:56:02,880
Such a weird pose.

1579
00:56:10,820 --> 00:56:14,460
(Zhao Xilun returns to his room)

1580
00:56:14,480 --> 00:56:15,200
Come in.

1581
00:56:17,440 --> 00:56:18,240
Okay.

1582
00:56:19,200 --> 00:56:20,000
Hey, guys.

1583
00:56:21,240 --> 00:56:22,320
Just grabbing something.

1584
00:56:26,800 --> 00:56:27,600
What's wrong?

1585
00:56:29,400 --> 00:56:31,960
I talked to Sha Yue'er about her situation.

1586
00:56:36,040 --> 00:56:37,520
There's a lot of outside pressure.

1587
00:56:38,200 --> 00:56:39,920
So we talked about it.

1588
00:56:41,640 --> 00:56:43,360
