I can't really smile right now.

1589
00:56:43,600 --> 00:56:44,360
What's wrong?

1590
00:56:44,800 --> 00:56:45,920
Come on. Let's go.

1591
00:56:57,560 --> 00:57:00,320
I know you're having a hard time.

1592
00:57:04,960 --> 00:57:07,560
I'm dealing with all this pressure.

1593
00:57:08,640 --> 00:57:10,400
And so are you.

1594
00:57:10,400 --> 00:57:11,200
Yeah.

1595
00:57:12,560 --> 00:57:15,840
We have to fight the whole world

1596
00:57:15,840 --> 00:57:17,760
