1597
00:57:18,040 --> 00:57:20,520
Don't you think we're kind of

1598
00:57:20,520 --> 00:57:21,360
pathetic?

1599
00:57:23,160 --> 00:57:24,480
A little, right?

1600
00:57:26,680 --> 00:57:28,800
We haven't done anything terrible.

1601
00:57:28,800 --> 00:57:29,600
So why

1602
00:57:30,840 --> 00:57:32,600
