1603
00:57:42,760 --> 00:57:44,120
Things will get better.

1604
00:57:44,120 --> 00:57:45,560
Give it time.

1605
00:57:53,840 --> 00:57:54,560
Don't cry.

1606
00:57:55,080 --> 00:57:56,000
You don't cry either.

1607
00:57:56,000 --> 00:57:57,080
I'm not crying.

1608
00:57:57,360 --> 00:57:58,400
You're crying!

1609
00:57:58,400 --> 00:57:59,280
You cried first.

1610
00:58:00,080 --> 00:58:01,160
You cried first.

1611
00:58:12,000 --> 00:58:12,800
Don't cry.

1612
00:58:13,120 --> 00:58:14,000
You stop crying.

1613
00:58:14,000 --> 00:58:14,880
Don't cry.

1614
00:58:17,120 --> 00:58:18,560
You're such a robot!

1615
00:58:19,900 --> 00:58:23,340
(Comforts her)

1616
00:58:27,440 --> 00:58:28,640
What happened to you two?

1617
00:58:30,480 --> 00:58:32,200
Why don't you two talk in the car?

1618
00:58:32,440 --> 00:58:33,840
Sure, let's go.

1619
00:58:34,640 --> 00:58:35,440
Sorry.

1620
00:58:35,800 --> 00:58:36,880
It's okay.

1621
00:58:37,040 --> 00:58:37,640
Let's go.

1622
00:58:41,680 --> 00:58:43,280
What about her? Is she okay?

1623
00:58:43,280 --> 00:58:44,600
She's been doing

1624
00:58:44,600 --> 00:58:45,560
pretty okay.

1625
00:58:45,560 --> 00:58:46,440
We just

1626
00:58:46,440 --> 00:58:47,440
had a little talk.

1627
00:58:48,680 --> 00:58:50,080
Told her to ignore all that stuff.

1628
00:58:51,110 --> 00:58:53,160
And I'm leaving to study abroad soon.

1629
00:58:53,640 --> 00:58:55,200
So I wanted to talk to her.

1630
00:58:55,900 --> 00:58:57,560
Then go spend some time with her.

1631
00:58:59,440 --> 00:59:00,360
I'll leave you two to it.

1632
00:59:00,680 --> 00:59:02,080
Bye!

1633
00:59:06,520 --> 00:59:07,060
Sha Yue'er.

1634
00:59:07,060 --> 00:59:08,460
(Sha Yue'er's room)

1635
00:59:12,800 --> 00:59:13,420
I'm removing my makeup.

1636
00:59:14,800 --> 00:59:15,880
Go ahead.

1637
00:59:15,880 --> 00:59:17,040
I went back to grab something.

1638
00:59:17,040 --> 00:59:18,480
Liang Renfang asked what was wrong.

1639
00:59:19,320 --> 00:59:19,960
Could they tell

1640
00:59:19,960 --> 00:59:20,800
I'd been crying?

1641
00:59:21,120 --> 00:59:21,920
It's obvious.

1642
00:59:22,480 --> 00:59:24,160
Don't cry anymore.

1643
00:59:24,160 --> 00:59:25,040
I won't.

1644
00:59:25,040 --> 00:59:26,480
Black streaks, white streaks,

1645
00:59:27,240 --> 00:59:28,040
and red streaks.

1646
00:59:30,520 --> 00:59:32,080
Wanna go upstairs
and hang out with them?

1647
00:59:32,760 --> 00:59:33,680
Sure.

1648
00:59:33,680 --> 00:59:35,000
But didn't you want some noodles?

1649
00:59:35,000 --> 00:59:36,200
I do.

1650
00:59:36,520 --> 00:59:38,080
I can bring a cup upstairs.

1651
00:59:38,440 --> 00:59:39,680
I'm really hungry.

1652
00:59:40,840 --> 00:59:42,080
The water is boiling.

1653
00:59:43,480 --> 00:59:44,200
Okay.

1654
00:59:44,200 --> 00:59:45,320
Thanks so much, babe.

1655
00:59:45,640 --> 00:59:47,000
Let's go find them upstairs.

1656
00:59:48,120 --> 00:59:49,320
Wonder if those two are feeling better.

1657
00:59:49,640 --> 00:59:50,320
Let's check.

1658
00:59:52,000 --> 00:59:53,480
Sha Yue'er!

1659
00:59:53,920 --> 00:59:54,600
Who is it?

1660
00:59:54,600 --> 00:59:55,400
Cui Kaiyi.

1661
00:59:57,680 --> 00:59:58,560
Sha Yue'er!

1662
00:59:58,560 --> 00:59:59,240
Welcome.

1663
00:59:59,240 --> 01:00:00,240
Want some instant noodles?

1664
01:00:00,240 --> 01:00:00,960
You want some?

1665
01:00:00,960 --> 01:00:01,960
Yes, I do!

1666
01:00:02,120 --> 01:00:03,160
I brought it up.

1667
01:00:03,160 --> 01:00:05,000
We can eat while playing board games.

1668
01:00:05,480 --> 01:00:07,000
Our makeup's completely worn off.

1669
01:00:08,400 --> 01:00:09,360
It's okay.

1670
01:00:09,360 --> 01:00:10,240
You could put on a face mask.

1671
01:00:10,240 --> 01:00:11,680
But I think you look beautiful
without makeup.

1672
01:00:11,680 --> 01:00:13,440
(Complimenting her)
You don't even need one.

1673
01:00:13,440 --> 01:00:14,880
Come on.

1674
01:00:14,880 --> 01:00:16,640
Sha Yue'er was the only one
who guessed wrong!

1675
01:00:16,640 --> 01:00:17,880
Why?

1676
01:00:17,880 --> 01:00:18,800
In control.

1677
01:00:20,920 --> 01:00:22,360
That's an adjective?

1678
01:00:23,120 --> 01:00:24,160
Heart Signal.

1679
01:00:31,280 --> 01:00:32,760
Cao Yiheng put this here, right?

1680
01:00:40,240 --> 01:00:41,280
Aren't you sleepy?

1681
01:00:41,280 --> 01:00:43,080
I'm afraid I'll fall asleep.

1682
01:00:43,860 --> 01:00:45,240
(Wu Xingying and Wu Siying's room)
Wouldn't it feel worse

1683
01:00:45,240 --> 01:00:46,360
