1684
01:00:47,320 --> 01:00:48,840
'll just go straight back to sleep.

1685
01:00:51,680 --> 01:00:53,360
Why are you so cute, babe?

1686
01:00:55,800 --> 01:00:57,560
Your cheeks are so chubby now.

1687
01:01:02,440 --> 01:01:03,800
Babe,

1688
01:01:03,800 --> 01:01:05,840
wanna sit on the balcony for a while

1689
01:01:05,840 --> 01:01:07,840
and watch the stars?

1690
01:01:15,080 --> 01:01:16,960
How was tonight?

1691
01:01:16,960 --> 01:01:17,960
Did you have fun?

1692
01:01:18,840 --> 01:01:19,480
It was pretty fun.

1693
01:01:19,480 --> 01:01:20,480
"Little paws".

1694
01:01:28,240 --> 01:01:29,680
You're so adorable, baby.

1695
01:01:29,680 --> 01:01:31,680
You're so cute, I could just kiss you!

1696
01:01:39,920 --> 01:01:40,560
Babe.

1697
01:01:42,480 --> 01:01:43,360
You know,

1698
01:01:43,920 --> 01:01:45,080
ever since I first met you,

1699
01:01:45,080 --> 01:01:46,160
even until now,

1700
01:01:46,960 --> 01:01:50,040
all the wonderful things about you...

1701
01:01:50,400 --> 01:01:52,000
haven't changed.

1702
01:01:52,000 --> 01:01:53,920
In fact,

1703
01:01:53,920 --> 01:01:56,440
I've discovered even more
to love about you.

1704
01:02:00,600 --> 01:02:03,480
You're genuinely kind at heart,

1705
01:02:03,480 --> 01:02:04,640
emotionally grounded,

1706
01:02:04,920 --> 01:02:07,320
and incredibly strong on the inside.

1707
01:02:07,760 --> 01:02:10,320
You're truly an amazing girl.

1708
01:02:11,800 --> 01:02:12,600
Yeah.

1709
01:02:13,040 --> 01:02:14,360
I feel the same about you.

1710
01:02:15,240 --> 01:02:16,240
Since leaving Signal House,

1711
01:02:17,000 --> 01:02:17,720
every time I see you,

1712
01:02:17,720 --> 01:02:19,080
I like you even more.

1713
01:02:19,640 --> 01:02:21,560
I was a little worried

1714
01:02:21,560 --> 01:02:22,480
things might change

1715
01:02:22,480 --> 01:02:23,440
once we left the house.

1716
01:02:25,360 --> 01:02:26,520
But they haven't.

1717
01:02:27,560 --> 01:02:28,480
Happy with

1718
01:02:28,480 --> 01:02:29,280
your sister's choice?

1719
01:02:30,120 --> 01:02:30,600
Yes.

1720
01:02:49,900 --> 01:02:52,040
Come on. Let's go for a walk.

1721
01:02:54,360 --> 01:02:55,840
They're right outside.

1722
01:02:56,760 --> 01:02:57,480
Hi!

1723
01:02:58,240 --> 01:02:58,840
Fang!

1724
01:02:59,360 --> 01:03:00,680
Wanna come look at the stars?

1725
01:03:00,680 --> 01:03:02,320
Liang Xiaoyu's already figuring it out.

1726
01:03:02,520 --> 01:03:03,280
Really?

1727
01:03:03,280 --> 01:03:05,680
They say you can see the moon's surface.

1728
01:03:05,680 --> 01:03:06,520
Through this?

1729
01:03:06,520 --> 01:03:07,400
Let me try.

1730
01:03:08,040 --> 01:03:09,360
Can you see anything?

1731
01:03:09,360 --> 01:03:10,560
No, it's all black.

1732
01:03:11,200 --> 01:03:12,980
(Guiding from afar)
Move it down a little more.

1733
01:03:13,020 --> 01:03:15,100
(Lower)

1734
01:03:15,560 --> 01:03:16,560
Oh, I see it!

1735
01:03:16,560 --> 01:03:17,700
(Let me have a look)

1736
01:03:18,480 --> 01:03:19,960
I'm heading over there.

1737
01:03:19,960 --> 01:03:21,140
(Moon, here I come)

1738
01:03:21,360 --> 01:03:22,520
You can see the stars.

1739
01:03:22,520 --> 01:03:23,320
The night sky.

1740
01:03:24,360 --> 01:03:24,920
Wait, no.

1741
01:03:24,920 --> 01:03:26,280
I think we're looking at a yurt.

1742
01:03:27,200 --> 01:03:27,920
Let me see.

1743
01:03:28,360 --> 01:03:29,880
You're pointing it right at the yurt.

1744
01:03:30,060 --> 01:03:31,500
(Toward the yurt)

1745
01:03:33,000 --> 01:03:34,160
Keep turning.

1746
01:03:34,160 --> 01:03:35,160
You'll see someone's bed.

1747
01:03:38,120 --> 01:03:39,280
Turn a little more
and you'll see inside.

1748
01:03:41,120 --> 01:03:41,600
This is hilarious.

1749
01:03:41,600 --> 01:03:43,400
Wait, let me adjust it again.

1750
01:03:43,880 --> 01:03:45,600
Let me check what we're looking at.

1751
01:03:50,120 --> 01:03:51,160
I see a star!

1752
01:03:51,160 --> 01:03:52,560
Now I can see Xing!

1753
01:03:52,560 --> 01:03:53,360
Where?

1754
01:03:53,640 --> 01:03:55,440
Over there!

1755
01:03:55,440 --> 01:03:56,840
I can see Xing now!

1756
01:03:57,000 --> 01:03:58,250
(The star herself)
Hello, everyone!

1757
01:03:58,280 --> 01:03:59,080
Hello!

1758
01:03:59,320 --> 01:04:00,240
Hi, Xing!

1759
01:04:00,440 --> 01:04:02,400
Hi!

1760
01:04:03,560 --> 01:04:05,040
Are you stargazing?

1761
01:04:05,040 --> 01:04:06,480
We really are.

1762
01:04:06,480 --> 01:04:07,560
We've been at it for an hour.

1763
01:04:07,560 --> 01:04:08,280
And now we've found you.

1764
01:04:09,200 --> 01:04:11,120
A real "star" moment.

1765
01:04:11,140 --> 01:04:12,760
(A real "star" moment)

1766
01:04:12,760 --> 01:04:13,560
A real star moment.

1767
01:04:14,640 --> 01:04:15,240
It really is.

1768
01:04:15,240 --> 01:04:16,480
A real "star".

1769
01:04:16,480 --> 01:04:18,500
(Sha Yue'er's room)
Isn't this Everlasting YiHeng?

1770
01:04:26,140 --> 01:04:27,980
(Sun Bohan and Cui Yihang's room)
It's freezing.

1771
01:04:40,420 --> 01:04:43,580
(Next episode)

1772
01:04:43,600 --> 01:04:44,560
Am I that obvious?

1773
01:04:44,720 --> 01:04:45,920
I look like I'm stealing eggs.

1774
01:04:46,080 --> 01:04:47,520
I pulled a little trick

1775
01:04:47,520 --> 01:04:48,800
to throw them off.

1776
01:04:48,800 --> 01:04:50,080
Everyone, test your mics. Come on.

1777
01:04:50,080 --> 01:04:51,040
Hello, Dai Xu.

1778
01:04:51,800 --> 01:04:53,680
You actually recognized me?

1779
01:04:53,680 --> 01:04:54,800
Yang Chaoyue.

1780
01:04:54,900 --> 01:04:55,940
(Ah)

1781
01:04:56,000 --> 01:04:56,880
Haitao.

1782
01:04:56,880 --> 01:04:58,720
You recognized me that quickly?

1783
01:04:58,720 --> 01:04:59,440
Meeting the parents already?

1784
01:04:59,440 --> 01:04:59,800
Auntie...

1785
01:04:59,800 --> 01:05:00,180
(Confidential)

1786
01:05:00,840 --> 01:05:01,800
(Teasing him to his face)
Could you put some lip balm on?

1787
01:05:04,740 --> 01:05:05,700
(Punches)
I'm gonna punch you.

1788
01:05:05,700 --> 01:05:06,900
(Acting cute)

1789
01:05:06,940 --> 01:05:08,060
(Watching the romance unfold)

1790
01:05:08,240 --> 01:05:08,840
Blink.

1791
01:05:08,980 --> 01:05:10,180
(Wink)

1792
01:05:11,840 --> 01:05:13,040
I'm watching from this close.

1793
01:05:13,940 --> 01:05:15,380
(Overwhelmed by the sweetness)

1794
01:05:21,120 --> 01:05:22,760
An emperor's horse really is different.

1795
01:05:26,240 --> 01:05:27,520
Wow, Xing. You're amazing.

1796
01:05:27,680 --> 01:05:28,560
Xing's riding up front,

1797
01:05:28,560 --> 01:05:29,560
just like a princess.

1798
01:05:30,280 --> 01:05:30,920
Xing,

1799
01:05:30,920 --> 01:05:31,880
everyone says

1800
01:05:31,880 --> 01:05:33,080
you really spoil Sun Bohan.

1801
01:05:33,080 --> 01:05:33,980
(Put on the spot)
What do you think?

1802
01:05:35,460 --> 01:05:36,260
(Confidential)

1803
01:05:37,280 --> 01:05:37,920
No one forced you.

1804
01:05:37,920 --> 01:05:39,480
What did Cao Yiheng say
that made your heart

1805
01:05:39,480 --> 01:05:40,520
flutter the most?

1806
01:05:40,520 --> 01:05:41,260
(Confidential)

1807
01:05:43,760 --> 01:05:44,760
What's the latest gift

1808
01:05:44,760 --> 01:05:45,640
you gave Si?

1809
01:05:45,640 --> 01:05:46,440
A dinnerware set.

1810
01:05:46,440 --> 01:05:47,480
We share one set.

1811
01:05:47,480 --> 01:05:48,160
You share a set?

1812
01:05:48,160 --> 01:05:50,040
So you two eat together all the time?

1813
01:05:50,040 --> 01:05:50,660
(Confidential)

1814
01:05:51,720 --> 01:05:53,200
(What did I just say?)
No.

1815
01:05:53,200 --> 01:05:54,240
I admire that about you.

1816
01:05:58,480 --> 01:05:59,600
The moon and stars.

1817
01:06:02,160 --> 01:06:03,080
How can the moon and stars

1818
01:06:03,080 --> 01:06:04,120
be so beautiful?

1819
01:06:05,840 --> 01:06:06,680
I'm so happy.

1820
01:06:08,120 --> 01:06:09,480
Such a beautiful view.

1821
01:06:09,840 --> 01:06:11,280
Just being with the one I love

1822
01:06:11,280 --> 01:06:12,200
makes me happy.

1823
01:06:13,240 --> 01:06:14,760
May the sparks

1824
01:06:14,760 --> 01:06:15,920
last forever!

1825
01:06:32,290 --> 01:06:35,010
♪Morning steam rises
from breakfast stalls♪

1826
01:06:35,010 --> 01:06:37,610
♪Packed subway cars,
barely room to breathe♪

1827
01:06:37,610 --> 01:06:41,810
♪Still half asleep, another day begins♪

1828
01:06:42,970 --> 01:06:45,690
♪The city glows beneath the towers♪

1829
01:06:45,690 --> 01:06:48,330
♪Somewhere beyond the clouds,
a sweet little date awaits♪

1830
01:06:48,330 --> 01:06:52,410
♪But first,
there are endless meetings to survive♪

1831
01:06:53,130 --> 01:06:54,530
♪Even if the fairy tale
only lasts a day♪

1832
01:06:54,530 --> 01:06:55,850
♪I'll still give it everything I have♪

1833
01:06:55,850 --> 01:06:57,170
♪Love out loud♪

1834
01:06:57,170 --> 01:06:58,570
♪Don't let this summer slip away♪

1835
01:06:58,570 --> 01:06:59,810
♪Cupid's arrow is already on its way♪

1836
01:06:59,810 --> 01:07:01,210
♪Don't act like you didn't see it♪

1837
01:07:01,210 --> 01:07:04,170
♪Just be a little braver♪

1838
01:07:04,170 --> 01:07:05,410
♪Keep moving♪

1839
01:07:05,530 --> 01:07:07,010
♪Keep moving♪

1840
01:07:07,010 --> 01:07:10,370
♪There's a little spark shining
in your eyes♪

1841
01:07:12,730 --> 01:07:15,090
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪

1842
01:07:25,530 --> 01:07:28,330
♪Keep moving♪

1843
01:07:28,330 --> 01:07:30,970
♪Life can be complicated,
yet beautifully simple♪

1844
01:07:30,970 --> 01:07:33,610
♪Go discover♪

1845
01:07:33,610 --> 01:07:36,290
♪That heartbeat you've been longing
to let out♪

1846
01:07:36,290 --> 01:07:38,970
♪Come closer♪

1847
01:07:38,970 --> 01:07:42,370
♪There's a little spark shining
in your eyes♪

1848
01:07:44,810 --> 01:07:47,610
♪That's the signal
of a heart coming alive♪"
